## Soft CTA / carousel

- ~80% shareable wishes / ~20% brand
- One mid-article gift section + coverflow carousel (Type 2, 16:9, product name + **Buy now**)
- For gift-guide intent, the carousel is not enough. Add an editorial product-recommendation section with 5–6 named BlueStone SKUs linked to PDPs, each mapped to a clear gifting reason and selection tip. Use competitor references for structure only; never copy phrasing or product blurbs.
- For Week 6 design-listicle intent, include named BlueStone examples where they genuinely clarify the style. For Week 6 buying-guide intent, keep product placement secondary and useful rather than forced.
- Trust line OK (shipping / 30-day) without scheme dump on pure wishes posts

